  "key": "4k49u8o",
  "text": "Start the exercise: Chest fly.",
  "style": "coach"
 },
 {
  "key": "l4flk16",
  "text": "Voice guide on. I'll talk you through each technique."
 },
 {
  "key": "swkn2n9",
  "text": "Breathe in"
 },
 {
  "key": "yj0o0a4",
  "text": "Hold"
 },
 {
  "key": "iloyy5d",
  "text": "And breathe out"
 },
 {
  "key": "wri1gxa",
  "text": "Hold softly"
 },
 {
  "key": "1vqy08kg",
  "text": "Slowly, breathe out"
 },
 {
  "key": "1s083hug",
  "text": "One more little sip"
 },
 {
  "key": "nhhdwuh",
  "text": "Long, slow breath out"
 },
 {
  "key": "x4ho6nq",
  "text": "Let's do box breathing together."
 },
 {
  "key": "16jipxz9",
  "text": "In for four"
 },
 {
  "key": "1qjp20vb",
  "text": "hold for four"
 },
 {
  "key": "l2tcu6a",
  "text": "out for four"
 },
 {
  "key": "v8g55ge",
  "text": "and hold for four."
 },
 {
  "key": "ae8bymh",
  "text": "Just follow my voice."
 },
 {
  "key": "1ig8cjet",
  "text": "Let's do four seven eight breathing."
 },
 {
  "key": "1zpj9jv",
  "text": "Breathe in through your nose for four"
 },
 {
  "key": "if73z5i",
  "text": "hold softly for seven"
 },
 {
  "key": "14o3d33s",
  "text": "and let a slow breath out for eight."
 },
 {
  "key": "hzvkvj1f",
  "text": "Let's do the physiological sigh. It's the fastest reset there is."
 },
 {
  "key": "brr4hjj",
  "text": "take a little top-up sip"
 },
 {
  "key": "nn248om",
  "text": "then a long, slow breath out."
 },
 {
  "key": "l4tkgt8",
  "text": "Settle in"
 },
 {
  "key": "11hequ4w",
  "text": "feel the weight of your body being held."
 },
 {
  "key": "1ukgbj3h",
  "text": "Follow one breath in"
 },
 {
  "key": "thqr87f",
  "text": "and all the way out."
 },
 {
  "key": "1g2lax616",
  "text": "Thoughts will come, let them drift past like clouds."
 },
 {
  "key": "17lzz5wn",
  "text": "Nothing to fix. Nowhere to be."
 },
 {
  "key": "1ijcbon10",
  "text": "Notice three sounds around you, near and far."
 },
 {
  "key": "4q8tppd",
  "text": "Soften your jaw"
 },
 {
  "key": "unt5g9d",
  "text": "your shoulders"
 },
 {
  "key": "ztl56s9",
  "text": "your hands."
 },
 {
  "key": "162tzr7j",
  "text": "You are allowed to rest."
 },
 {
  "key": "gaapz9w",
  "text": "Come back to the breath. It's always here."
 },
 {
  "key": "xywls1f",
  "text": "Beautifully done."
 },
 {
  "key": "re4hejy",
  "text": "That's 2 minutes you gave back to yourself."
 },
 {
  "key": "wuf09oy",
  "text": "That's 5 minutes you gave back to yourself."
 },
 {
  "key": "n840rsz",
  "text": "That's 10 minutes you gave back to yourself."
 },
 {
  "key": "9tjmryn",
  "text": "Make yourself comfortable"
 },
 {
  "key": "173rfuth",
  "text": "and when you're ready"
 },
 {
  "key": "ix2hzq",
  "text": "allow your eyes to gently close."
 },
 {
  "key": "1618jabl",
  "text": "Take a slow, deep breath in"
 },
 {
  "key": "1qhyh8ma",
  "text": "and let it go"
 },
 {
  "key": "rjvghiq",
  "text": "feeling your shoulders soften."
 },
 {
  "key": "17oo5ngi",
  "text": "With every breath out"
 },
 {
  "key": "1885xvpl",
  "text": "you drift a little deeper"
 },
 {
  "key": "yj019i4",
  "text": "calm"
 },
 {
  "key": "yjccl04",
  "text": "safe"
 },
 {
  "key": "n45r6u7",
  "text": "relaxed."
 },
 {
  "key": "q8wkz915",
  "text": "Imagine a warm, gentle light at the top of your head"
 },
 {
  "key": "1qjsr3w",
  "text": "slowly melting down through your body"
 },
 {
  "key": "t5nofps",
  "text": "relaxing every muscle it touches."
 },
 {
  "key": "kl8y26f",
  "text": "Deeper and deeper"
 },
 {
  "key": "bx631ag",
  "text": "heavier and calmer"
 },
 {
  "key": "1llfvc3x",
  "text": "there is nothing you need to do right now."
 },
 {
  "key": "8fdyifi",
  "text": "And in this calm place"
 },
 {
  "key": "18cx4qqu",
  "text": "your mind is open to positive change."
 },
 {
  "key": "1fbj12s9",
  "text": "From today"
 },
 {
  "key": "17fd1wkc",
  "text": "you eat slowly"
 },
 {
  "key": "1xx1v4fo",
  "text": "and you truly taste your food."
 },
 {
  "key": "1okrs2j16",
  "text": "You notice the gentle feeling of having had enough"
 },
 {
  "key": "wj0l01k",
  "text": "and stopping feels easy"
 },
 {
  "key": "2u9wvhd",
  "text": "and satisfying."
 },
 {
  "key": "ody4z3u",
  "text": "You reach for foods that nourish you"
 },
 {
  "key": "9dhubch",
  "text": "water refreshes you"
 },
 {
  "key": "1n3hw7wh",
  "text": "movement feels good."
 },
 {
  "key": "m8ebh2f",
  "text": "When stress comes"
 },
 {
  "key": "1qxnteza",
  "text": "you breathe"
 },
 {
  "key": "1cjrkr88",
  "text": "you pause"
 },
 {
  "key": "1t43s54d",
  "text": "you choose calm"
 },
 {
  "key": "1w6rn3xs",
  "text": "food is not the answer to a feeling."
 },
 {
  "key": "1omfyrhu",
  "text": "You speak to yourself with kindness"
 },
 {
  "key": "go5z4di",
  "text": "like someone you love."
 },
 {
  "key": "kailby8",
  "text": "Day by day"
 },
 {
  "key": "3wuoqug",
  "text": "your body responds"
 },
 {
  "key": "1sptuh87",
  "text": "lighter"
 },
 {
  "key": "1x1x3y98",
  "text": "stronger"
 },
 {
  "key": "io3f8md",
  "text": "more confident."
 },
 {
  "key": "60fn1ps",
  "text": "See yourself a few months from now"
 },
 {
  "key": "qpjq1oc",
  "text": "standing tall"
 },
 {
  "key": "4qsmuqi",
  "text": "clothes fitting well"
 },
 {
  "key": "1anqcfy7",
  "text": "smiling"
 },
 {
  "key": "1kkyq5hk",
  "text": "proud of how you got here."
 },
 {
  "key": "15x4r9cf",
  "text": "That person is you"
 },
 {
  "key": "1l22ehgf",
  "text": "already on the way."
 },
 {
  "key": "1jy16jwu",
  "text": "In a moment I'll count from one to five"
 },
 {
  "key": "ng8y57y",
  "text": "and you'll return refreshed and positive."
 },
 {
  "key": "375ny93",
  "text": "One"
 },
 {
  "key": "xklvy9i",
  "text": "energy returning. Two"
 },
 {
  "key": "1080fa8k",
  "text": "breathing deeper. Three"
 },
 {
  "key": "12aosysi",
  "text": "aware of the room. Four"
 },
 {
  "key": "11aixeie",
  "text": "almost back. Five"
 },
 {
  "key": "3te5wtx",
  "text": "eyes open, wide awake, feeling wonderful."
 },
 {
  "key": "113n5p0b",
  "text": "I love myself."
 },
 {
  "key": "1p9xzry9",
  "text": "I am enough."
 },
 {
  "key": "xxb8wng",
  "text": "I believe in myself."
 },
 {
  "key": "174ledug",
  "text": "I am getting better."
 },
 {
  "key": "11hr41ei",
  "text": "I am eating healthier."
 },
 {
  "key": "kedpyhe",
  "text": "I am feeling good."
 },
 {
  "key": "1ji5tulg",
  "text": "I am proud of myself."
 },
 {
  "key": "zk46gw9",
  "text": "You're safe."
 },
 {
  "key": "1lz4ytwp",
  "text": "This feeling is a wave. It rises"
 },
 {
  "key": "1419bh07",
  "text": "it peaks"
 },
 {
  "key": "azl75xh",
  "text": "and it always passes."
 },
 {
  "key": "onaw9r16",
  "text": "Let's slow your breathing down together. Breathe in"
 },
 {
  "key": "1e1x7q4h",
  "text": "You did it. You're here."
 },
 {
  "key": "36aef91t",
  "text": "The wave is passing. Sit for a minute, breathe slowly, and be gentle with yourself."
 },
 {
  "key": "1oerm291b",
  "text": "Panic is exhausting, and you just handled it brilliantly."
 },
 {
  "key": "num4pta",
  "text": "You are safe."
 },
 {
  "key": "lanp0720",
  "text": "Your body has hit a false alarm, and we're going to switch it off by bringing you back to now."
 },
 {
  "key": "y07hu9x",
  "text": "Slow breaths out as you go. Take your time."
 },
 {
  "key": "auqaif8",
  "text": "Well done."
 },
 {
  "key": "19vl6nru",
  "text": "Tap the button each time you find one."
 },
 {
  "key": "1a7n41bf",
  "text": "Good. Just one more."
 },
 {
  "key": "1nxye92k",
  "text": "Find 5 things you can see."
 },
 {
  "key": "aowrusy",
  "text": "Say each one out loud, 'blue mug', 'door handle'"
 },
 {
  "key": "1jyu6dj9",
  "text": "Good. 4 more."
 },
 {
  "key": "1k27af49",
  "text": "Good. 3 more."
 },
 {
  "key": "1k2tmpt9",
  "text": "Good. 2 more."
 },
 {
  "key": "ws5mghm",
  "text": "Find 4 things you can touch."
 },
 {
  "key": "1y8en4d18",
  "text": "Actually touch them. Notice texture and temperature."
 },
 {
  "key": "wn8c8dl",
  "text": "Find 3 things you can hear."
 },
 {
  "key": "1qaxicjm",
  "text": "Near sounds and far sounds."
 },
 {
  "key": "1mk3ertm",
  "text": "Find 2 things you can smell."
 },
 {
  "key": "1qd7i48z",
  "text": "Or two smells you love, remembered vividly."
 },
 {
  "key": "156elp1l",
  "text": "Find 1 thing you can taste."
 },
 {
  "key": "mfdndk13",
  "text": "Or take one slow sip of water and really taste it."
 },
 {
  "key": "py0q8yp",
  "text": "Soften your gaze on the circle."
 },
 {
  "key": "c9lkbii",
  "text": "Breathe in the colour."
 },
 {
  "key": "ukc1l6u",
  "text": "And breathe it out, through your body."
 },
 {
  "key": "ow6pbsb",
  "text": "Calming blue."
 },
 {
  "key": "195kdfez",
  "text": "Slows a racing mind, steady like deep water."
 },
 {
  "key": "r62rnhe",
  "text": "Balancing green."
 },
 {
  "key": "1ig5inlt",
  "text": "Nature's reset, balance and renewal."
 },
 {
  "key": "1fpr68j9",
  "text": "Warm peach."
 },
 {
  "key": "1ey9yohx",
  "text": "Self-kindness and comfort, without food."
 },
 {
  "key": "hdhw89f",
  "text": "Restful lavender."
 },
 {
  "key": "1f9jiyfr",
  "text": "Softens a busy mind before sleep."
 },
 {
  "key": "1z0u1xvd",
  "text": "Confident gold."
 },
 {
  "key": "twkthtx",
  "text": "Warmth and self-belief for the day ahead."
 },
 {
  "key": "fns4mu1a",
  "text": "Start with the karate chop point, on the side of your hand."
 },
 {
  "key": "im7o3914",
  "text": "Tap it continuously, and say this out loud with me."
 },
 {
  "key": "2t45ad5",
  "text": "Again."
 },
 {
  "key": "1vmkmf5b",
  "text": "One more time."
 },
 {
  "key": "yq6brhf",
  "text": "Tap gently, and say"
 },
 {
  "key": "r04q9ad",
  "text": "Round complete."
 },
 {
  "key": "1rpke6bf",
  "text": "Take a deep breath."
 },
 {
  "key": "9x5dbj2t",
  "text": "How strong is the feeling now, from zero to ten? If it's still above a three or four, go again. Most people need two or three rounds."
 },
 {
  "key": "6dsptc1m",
  "text": "Even though I have this craving, I deeply and completely accept myself."
 },
 {
  "key": "190wq3pb",
  "text": "this craving."
 },
 {
  "key": "1kh80ba1l",
  "text": "Even though I feel this stress, I deeply and completely accept myself."
 },
 {
  "key": "111ny2ba",
  "text": "this stress."
 },
 {
  "key": "jor7th1b",
  "text": "Even though I've been hard on myself, I choose kindness now."
 },
 {
  "key": "16c1r76h",
  "text": "this old harsh voice."
 },
 {
  "key": "13uupfda",
  "text": "Karate chop."
 },
 {
  "key": "1vmrhdb9",
  "text": "Top of head."
 },
 {
  "key": "4e7xxw7",
  "text": "Eyebrow."
 },
 {
  "key": "g1j0xa9",
  "text": "Side of eye."
 },
 {
  "key": "1nf7hhw8",
  "text": "Under eye."
 },
 {
  "key": "173r7mi9",
  "text": "Under nose."
 },
 {
  "key": "xz76i2a",
  "text": "Chin crease."
 },
 {
  "key": "16c6en0a",
  "text": "Collarbone."
 },
 {
  "key": "1nf7l0z8",
  "text": "Under arm."
 },
 {
  "key": "hbgvije",
  "text": "Craving Crusher."
 },
 {
  "key": "1pnrdb42f",
  "text": "Close your eyes and picture the food you're craving. Make the image big, bright, close, notice how it pulls you."
 },
 {
  "key": "olg74p13",
  "text": "Now imagine grabbing that image with your hand"
 },
 {
  "key": "zfir0el",
  "text": "and shrinking it: smaller"
 },
 {
  "key": "ih03ji6",
  "text": "darker"
 },
 {
  "key": "iuqkir6",
  "text": "duller"
 },
 {
  "key": "1nfuf8x",
  "text": "push it far away until it's a tiny grey dot."
 },
 {
  "key": "1gw43nm31",
  "text": "In its place, snap in a big bright image of you, confident, lighter, glowing, proud. Make it vivid: what are you wearing? How are you standing?"
 },
 {
  "key": "fqo2d31v",
  "text": "Say the word 'swish' in your head as the new image replaces the old one. Feel the shift."
 },
 {
  "key": "1avecu132",
  "text": "Repeat 5 times, faster each time: craving image up, then swish, then confident you. By round five the craving image struggles to even form."
 },
 {
  "key": "1e02n7a23",
  "text": "Open your eyes. Notice the craving now, most people find it's dropped from a shout to a whisper."
 },
 {
  "key": "1dp60v3a",
  "text": "Calm Anchor."
 },
 {
  "key": "1genj6432",
  "text": "Remember a moment you felt completely calm and in control, a beach, a walk, a hug. Step into that memory: see what you saw, hear what you heard."
 },
 {
  "key": "1kc3a4d2h",
  "text": "As the calm feeling builds, press your thumb and middle finger together firmly. Hold while the feeling peaks"
 },
 {
  "key": "kcu6t7b",
  "text": "then release."
 },
 {
  "key": "1lm5oxxz",
  "text": "Break state, look around, count 3 red things."
 },
 {
  "key": "13ysenf2r",
  "text": "Repeat 3 more times with the same memory (or a new calm one). Same fingers, same pressure. You're wiring a physical 'calm button'."
 },
 {
  "key": "18r5qx3x",
  "text": "Test it: press thumb and finger together"
 },
 {
  "key": "2fvb6h20",
  "text": "notice calm arriving. Use it before meals, in the biscuit aisle, or when stress says 'snack'."
 },
 {
  "key": "53iyr9",
  "text": "Future You."
 },
 {
  "key": "1ydrk3l2m",
  "text": "Close your eyes. Imagine it's 6 months from now, and everything went well, you stayed consistent, kindly, imperfectly."
 },
 {
  "key": "8x3fb71z",
  "text": "See Future You across the room. Notice her posture, her clothes, the ease in how she moves."
 },
 {
  "key": "w1i9tm1v",
  "text": "Walk over. Ask her: 'What was the one thing that mattered most?' Listen to what she says."
 },
 {
  "key": "u5tz9n16",
  "text": "Ask: 'What should I stop worrying about?' Listen again."
 },
 {
  "key": "1waaqpf29",
  "text": "Now step into her body. Feel what it's like, lighter, stronger, calm around food. Memorise this feeling."
 },
 {
  "key": "px1on62j",
  "text": "Open your eyes and write down her two answers in your check-in this week. She's not imaginary, she's you, on schedule."
 },
 {
  "key": "18c6ezen",
  "text": "Your thoughts are not facts."
 },
 {
  "key": "llsy9h1i",
  "text": "Old beliefs, like I can't do it, were learned. So they can be unlearned."
 },
 {
  "key": "1qa6mv722",
  "text": "Which thought sounds like you? Pick the one that feels most true right now, or write your own."
 },
 {
  "key": "1lce9htp",
  "text": "Where do you think it came from?"
 },
 {
  "key": "1g5rq52h",
  "text": "A belief is just a thought you've thought many times. It was learned, not born with you, which means it can change."
 },
 {
  "key": "1e6go0oe",
  "text": "Let's question it."
 },
 {
  "key": "d4wta1x",
  "text": "One. When has this not been true, even once?"
 },
 {
  "key": "98w0n21b",
  "text": "Two. What would you say to your best friend if she said this?"
 },
 {
  "key": "qvez44w",
  "text": "Three. What has believing this cost you?"
 },
 {
  "key": "1sq60ixd",
  "text": "Your new belief."
 },
 {
  "key": "r9e8ip1t",
  "text": "Make it something you can believe today. A step forward, rather than a giant leap."
 },
 {
  "key": "1qafdfmv",
  "text": "Edit the words so they feel like yours."
 },
 {
  "key": "1w8echob",
  "text": "Make it stick."
 },
 {
  "key": "j874671u",
  "text": "Every morning, it joins your mirror ritual. Say it out loud, looking into your eyes."
 },
 {
  "key": "1sfewu516",
  "text": "Every day, add one piece of proof. Small proof counts"
 },
 {
  "key": "q3vjcj11",
  "text": "a glass of water, a walk, a kind word to yourself."
 },
 {
  "key": "rmivgd24",
  "text": "When the old thought comes back, notice it, say that's an old thought, and repeat your new belief."
 },
 {
  "key": "ow7fpvf",
  "text": "Your new belief is"
 }
]
